ia\n53\t\n54\t- When the Feature Store is enabled for a project, the Dashboard shows it as an\n55\t  enabled component.\n56\t- The Dashboard links users to the Feature Store endpoints for that project.\n57\t- The Feature Store surfaces are gated by the Dashboard's component feature\n58\t  flag / config mechanism and default to the supported posture.\n59\t- No feature-authoring UI is introduced (link-out only, per the strategy's\n60\t  out-of-scope list).\n61\t\n62\t## HLR Traceability\n63\t\n64\t- **HLR-3** (P1): the Dashboard shows the Feature Store as an enabled\n65\t  component and links users to its endpoints per project.\n66\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-84770da2226bea01","agent_id":"afa180ea5d2d1d026","session_id":"ca8f2d08-a517-4b91-9d11-cd8562c17ecd","uuid":"1910f771-f002-4484-ba4f-fc6e003f61d9","timestamp":"2026-10-22T17:50:15.888Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-912889d83febc772","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Review RHAISTRAT-9006 decomposition"}
